# Compose rules

- Use Compose v2 modular files under `compose/`; max ~150 lines per file.
- Use profiles for optional services (Plex, proxy, recyclarr). `docker-socket-proxy` always runs with Homepage (ADR 0022).
- Stateful services: `stop_grace_period: 60s`.
- VPN mode: qBittorrent `network_mode: service:gluetun`; publish qBit ports on Gluetun; healthcheck gate.
- Mount qBit cont-init at `/custom-cont-init.d` via `${CONFIG_DIR}/qbittorrent-cont-init` (not under `/config`).
- Never attach *arr, Seerr, Jellyfin, or Bazarr to Gluetun netns.
- All download/library services mount the same `${DATA_DIR}:/data` parent.
- Dual-mode via exclusive include: `downloaders-${FLIXBOX_MODE}.yml` (`direct`|`vpn`) — do not define two `qbittorrent` services in one project.
- Early development may have used `:latest` (ADR 0010); **v0.1+ must pin** — see `docs/user/14-image-pins.md` (CI fails on `:latest`).
- `servarr.yml`: Prowlarr, Radarr, Sonarr, Bazarr, Byparr (not FlareSolverr by default).
- `requests.yml`: Seerr with `init: true` (`ghcr.io/seerr-team/seerr`).
- `optimization.yml`: Unpackerr, Recyclarr, Decluttarr, Maintainerr — follow `docs/09-hygiene-defaults.md`.
- Decluttarr qBit URL is always `http://qbittorrent:8080` (ADR 0014 — Gluetun aliases `qbittorrent` in VPN mode).
- Do not add Lidarr/Readarr/SABnzbd/Whisper/Autobrr unless scope expands.
